description:Extend curator-spec with the accepted schema-7/rc.5 contract for source-audited external Git repositories and incorporate the authorized portable manager-owned go-v1 host-execution policy. Preserve closed package-influence boundaries while separating portable delivery from the future hardened sandbox profile.
