+- EVIDENCE: `.research/260729_audit-language-story-dependency-cycle.md`; `.temp/TASK-260729-iuepxx/verify-cycle.js` exits 0. The live plan remains expected-red with exit 1; all live dependency/parent probes confirm no graph mutation was applied.
