+- FINDING: exhaustive weighted feedback-edge search proves seven unlinks are the minimum purely acyclic cut, but the cut removes four hard specification prerequisites and three real Linux qualification-ordering links. No link/unlink-only repair can preserve the mandatory phase edges.
+- RECOMMENDATION: preserve all blocker links and phase-align ownership instead: move the three language design tasks plus the two toolchain wire-spec tasks into the additional-language protocol story, and move shared Linux toolchain qualification into the Linux qualification story. A full isolated board copy produces an acyclic epic plan after those six parent moves.
